gens.text:
At checkout, the scanner beeps;
to pay, she needs to swipe her card,
as behind, another waits, crowding slightly.
The cart rolls past the divider bar,
where the cashier totals up each item scanned;
nearby, a receipt prints out, loyalty points sought.
Shouldering her bag, she scans the barcode,
while beside, items pile up on the belt,
awaiting turn to be bagged and checked.
Beside her, another shopper jostles,
pressing close, eager for space in line;
she steps back, allowing room for both,
as routines hum along at busy checkout.
